{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Experience Tunnel Baby's Fist Act</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play through the first act of Tunnel Baby in this gameplay demo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Confront the Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the shoes of civil engineer Steve Wilkins as he embarks on a routine repair job turned survival challenge. In this demo, you'll experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Claustrophobic Passageways</strong>: Navigate the Plum River utility tunnels where danger and mystery lurks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combat</strong>: Defend yourself against otherworldly creatures using just a lead pipe and a flashlight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzles</strong>: Test your wits as you solve environmental puzzles essential for progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unravel Mysteries</strong>: Begin to uncover the start of story behind the secret of the Baby in the tunnel. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo focuses exclusively on the gameplay elements and narrative from the first act, setting the stage for what unfolds in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3256440?t=1741104321","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741104321","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256440/8588e0999c6968348ea9a3773cd59ddf7f737d7a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741104321","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256440/8588e0999c6968348ea9a3773cd59ddf7f737d7a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741104321","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","i